# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`qiskit-fermions` extends the Qiskit SDK with tools for working on fermionic systems. Within its scope it provides the following:\n"
msgstr "Pinalalawak ng `qiskit-fermions` ang Qiskit SDK gamit ang mga tool para sa pagtatrabaho sa mga fermionic system. Sa saklaw nito, nagbibigay ito ng sumusunod:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Efficient data structures for the representation and manipulation of fermionic operators in different forms\n"
msgstr "Mga episyenteng data structure para sa representasyon at pagmamanipula ng mga fermionic operator sa iba't ibang anyo\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A framework for implementing operator conversion methods (including fermion-to-qubit encodings)\n"
msgstr "Isang framework para sa pagpapatupad ng mga paraan ng operator conversion (kasama ang mga fermion-to-qubit encoding)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A library of efficient implementations of common conversion methods\n"
msgstr "Isang library ng mga episyenteng implementasyon ng mga karaniwang paraan ng conversion\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A framework and library of gates for expressing fermionic circuits\n"
msgstr "Isang framework at library ng mga gate para sa pagpapahayag ng mga fermionic circuit\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A transpilation pipeline integrated with the Qiskit transpiler process to synthesize fermionic circuits into qubit-based circuits\n"
msgstr "Isang transpilation pipeline na isinama sa transpiler process ng Qiskit para i-synthesize ang mga fermionic circuit sa mga circuit na nakabatay sa qubit\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Additionally, `qiskit-fermions` integrates with other tools of the ecosystem, such as:\n"
msgstr "Bukod pa rito, nag-iintegrate ang `qiskit-fermions` sa iba pang tool ng ecosystem, tulad ng:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[ffsim](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/) for the high-level ansatz operators and efficient simulation of fermionic circuits (see [Relationship to ffsim](#relationship-to-ffsim))\n"
msgstr "[ffsim](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/) para sa mga high-level na ansatz operator at episyenteng simulation ng mga fermionic circuit (tingnan ang [Relationship to ffsim](#relationship-to-ffsim))\n"

