#, no-wrap
msgid "This package follows [semantic versioning](https://semver.org/). Breaking changes are made only occasionally, to improve the user experience. When possible, old interfaces are kept and marked as deprecated for as long as they can co-exist with the new ones. Each substantial improvement, breaking change, or deprecation is documented in the [Release Notes](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/release-notes#release-notes).\n"
msgstr "Sumusunod ang package na ito sa [semantic versioning](https://semver.org/). Paminsan-minsan lang ginagawa ang mga breaking change, para mapabuti ang karanasan ng user. Kapag posible, pinananatili ang mga lumang interface at minamarkahan bilang deprecated hangga't maaari silang mag-co-exist sa mga bago. Dokumentado sa [Release Notes](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/release-notes#release-notes) ang bawat malaking pagpapabuti, breaking change, o deprecation.\n"

